0/extras/55d430b8951fe19a584d136d78ef3c4d.poster.avif?t=1745582226\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163470/extras/55d430b8951fe19a584d136d78ef3c4d.webm?t=1745582226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163470/extras/55d430b8951fe19a584d136d78ef3c4d.mp4?t=1745582226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspenseful, psychological horror elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163470/extras/69982460ba1f4c9eb73b813b5c7f6564.poster.avif?t=1745582226\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163470/extras/69982460ba1f4c9eb73b813b5c7f6564.webm?t=1745582226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163470/extras/69982460ba1f4c9eb73b813b5c7f6564.mp4?t=1745582226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
